# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository so students on Windows, macOS and Linux
# don't see whole-file diffs caused purely by CRLF vs LF. All files currently committed
# already use LF, so this changes nothing today - it only prevents future churn.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never treat these as text - they must round-trip byte for byte.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
